---
// Buttondown: subscription_confirmation_redirect_url. Shown after the confirm link is clicked.
// This page is the "what happens next" message: the welcome email can't be edited on
// Buttondown's free plan, so it lives here instead. Keep it in step with the form's promise
// ("invites go out in batches") and Privacy Policy §3(f) / §7 (list deleted after launch).
import WaitlistNotice from '../../components/WaitlistNotice.astro';
import SurveyLink from '../../components/SurveyLink.astro';

// Set once the questionnaire exists. Unset, step 1 says it will arrive by email.
const surveyUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_WAITLIST_SURVEY_URL;
---
<WaitlistNotice
  title="You’re on the list — Lysning"
  description="You’re on the Lysning beta list. Here’s what happens next."
  eyebrow="You’re on the list"
>
  <h1>You’re in. Here’s what <em class="warm">happens next.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Lysning shows you when each of your goals becomes affordable — a deposit, a wedding, a
    cushion — from what you can really set aside after your bills.
  </p>

  <ol class="steps">
    <li>
      <span class="num">1</span>
      <div>
        <h2>A short questionnaire</h2>
        {surveyUrl ? (
          <>
            <p>
              Four questions, about a minute. It’s how we choose each batch, so the list alone
              isn’t quite enough — nothing about your figures. Already answered it while you
              waited? You’re all set.
            </p>
            <SurveyLink ref="confirmed-page" />
          </>
        ) : (
          <p>About a minute, arriving by email from hello@lysning.app. It helps us put a good mix of people in each batch — nothing about your figures.</p>
        )}
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="num">2</span>
      <div>
        <h2>Invites go out in small batches</h2>
        <p>By email, through Apple’s TestFlight — iPhone first. Not in the first batch? You stay on the list for the next one.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="num">3</span>
      <div>
        <h2>One email when Lysning is live</h2>
        <p>Then we delete the list. Every email has a one-click unsubscribe in the meantime.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <p class="aside">
    Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@lysning.app">hello@lysning.app</a> — it reaches a person.
  </p>
</WaitlistNotice>
